  "contracts": [
    "Private business token, active API subscription; authentication401 versus plan403.",
    "Explicit sms, asynchronous same-business public profile lookup and exact existing destination; origin channel identifier and current-country routing.",
    "200 received without ID or assurance of message creation; pending/dispatched/routed/delivered/error; documented failed compatibility. Nullable Unix-second timestamps and no transition history.",
    "Business cursor list with no profile/date/template filters, limit25; correlation may be ambiguous and no request idempotency.",
    "SMS template body only; template takes precedence; named URLs required. Valid shortlink syntax creates actual message short links asynchronously; do not execute for evidence.",
    "GSM extension characters occupy two units; single capacities160/140/70. Multipart limits and emoji depend on final encoding/provider. Current encoder info parts_count and conservative UTF16 grapheme splitting differ, so no universal multipart formula published.",
    "Daily limits checked before creation and delivery, monthly before delivery. Acceptance is not consent or delivery; retries can coexist with provider processing."
  ],
